  m_Name: Aristocrat Huxley
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Aristocrat Huxley
  offerText: Allow my porters to store this velvet-lined chest in your quarters.
    I will pay you a modest fee for the floor space, and its sheer elegance will
    surely lift your mood.
  acceptResultText: The porters drop the chest and hand you the money. However, the
    chest emits a terrible, rotting odor that completely ruins the atmosphere of
    your room.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to hold his mysterious cargo. The fresh air in your
    room feels wonderful.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Huxley abandoned the chest in the hallway. The authorities
    opened it, found smuggled gemstones, and paid you a massive reward for reporting
    it!
